{
  "date": "2025-01-13",
  "messages": [
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 와써~ ♡\n방콕을 처음으로 월드투어가 시작됐는데\n방콕이 첫무대였어서 그런지 실수도 많았고 아쉬운점도 많았는데 앞으로도 보여줄수있는 무대가 많이 남아있어서 다행이다 ㅎㅎ\n처음보여주는 다른유닛곡들 열심히 준비했는데 좋아해줘서 행복하당\n내 인생 첫 태국을 첫월드투어로 남아서 그날을 난 절대 잊지못할거야☺️\n남은 투어 무대들은 더 나아진모습 보여줄테니까 끝까지 기대해줘",
      "en": "I'm back~ ♡\nOur World Tour officially began in Bangkok. Maybe because it was our very first stop, I made quite a few mistakes and there were a lot of things I wish I could've done better. But I'm thankful there are still plenty of stages left where I can show you an improved version of myselfㅎㅎ\nWe worked really hard to prepare the new unit songs we were performing for the first time, so I'm really happy that you liked them.\nMy first-ever trip to Thailand became the first stop of my very first World Tour, so I'll never forget that day☺️\nI'll keep showing you better performances throughout the rest of the tour, so please look forward to it until the very end."
    },
